<title>DUBAI: Caltex hikes Bahrain wholesale diesel price.</title>
<headline>Caltex hikes Bahrain wholesale diesel price.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil firm Caltex, the Texaco Inc and Chevron Corp joint venture, has increased the posted price of diesel exported from Bahrain to a year high.</p>
<p>Diesel (B800 grade) has been increased by three cents a U.S. gallon to 74 cents a gallon, a statement received in Dubai from Caltex's office in Britain said.</p>
<p>Caltex's posted, or wholesale price, of diesel in early October 1995 was 52 cents a gallon.</p>
<p>International diesel prices soared to five year highs last week because of low oil inventory levels in the United States ahead of the northern hemisphere's winter.</p>
<p>-- Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
</text>
